      "reset": {
        "description": "Reset the emulator with CAN then RIS. The request and successful response are {}. Acceptance is asynchronous: with data clients, the mux waits up to 250ms for a parser-ground boundary so the same bytes follow earlier output. Forced application still resets authoritative state and requires data clients to reconnect. Dimensions, configured defaults, block identity, size ownership, the child process, and the PTY are preserved.",
